@startuml
' Saque status lifecycle with admin/shop permission split
' Shop can only cancel; admin can approve/reject
' Admin actions only valid from pending state

[*] --> pending : Saque created

state pending : Awaiting admin review
state approved : Funds committed
state rejected : Denied by admin\n(motivo stored)
state cancelled <<end>> : Cancelled by shop

pending --> approved : Admin approve\n(balance re-checked)
pending --> rejected : Admin reject\n(motivo required)
pending --> cancelled : Shop cancel

approved --> [*]
rejected --> [*]

note on link #gray : Shop PUT restricted to cancelled only
@enduml
